   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **State of the Art (A.E.I.O.U.)(Jim James song)** (1 review): The listener describes this particular song as an absolute face melter [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Just One Thing(first time since July 18, 2013)**: back after 133 archived shows (2803 days) [5]\n- **Wonderful (The Way I Feel)**: with Eric Johnson [5]\n- **Steam Engine**: with Johnny Quaid [5]\n- **Knockin' on Heaven's Door(Bob Dylan cover)**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances; with Johnny Quaid [5]\n- **Run Thru**: with Johnny Quaid [5]\n- **Tyrone(Erykah Badu cover)**: back after 61 archived shows (1354 days) [5]\n- **Purple Rain(Prince cover)**: rare: 4 archived performances; with Johnny Quaid [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2016-05-28.MMJ2016-05-28RedRocks** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 172 min; rated 3/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Eric Johnson, Johnny Quaid [1]\n- Eric Johnson joined the band for this specific performance [1]\n- Johnny Quaid performed a duet with the band on this track [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2016-05-28.MMJ2016-05-28RedRocks**: taped by Pat Myers; transferred by Pat Myers AKA Dat Pat; source: Neumann U-89i's>Zoom F-8 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Furthur Frames: [My Morning Jacket Red Rocks Amphitheater , 5/28/2016 - Furthur Frames](https://furthurframes.com/product/my-morning-jacket-red-rocks-amphitheater-5-28-2016/) [6]",
